{"id": "clm:3dc46fe07657328844730c1f1b54293a9d211159c46bd919bd04024465331cec", "type": "statement", "text": "Percona warns that local engines may reject the OpenAI dimensions field and says to enable forwarding only for supporting models. Ollama independently lists dimensions among supported /v1/embeddings request fields. The generic Percona warning does not establish universal Ollama rejection. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-11-06)", "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-search-for-mongodb/configure-automatic-embedding.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["mongot autoEmbed with OpenAI-compatible providers"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://docs.ollama.com/api/openai-compatibility.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:ec96234ec7d4b1e407039b66dc4bc64da4f18da3662e1cbc57eabcb615e68124", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1c0e209cdf3089c4f4b21af7dc1ba353f3c11b54ddd1318c8d385cca10d7e949", "ev:8b15ab072148fd88edd8ab054a0235f92ec4ff234b9f6dcb23433e7b676ca56c", "ev:dbca0c5080156d1866a4fc2093cddf570479cd78f91d665715064dae42c8b35b", "ev:f23c86c766f9de734bdf914db1fa18bd5e6f349f2fafc106c19bf99ab926fa9a"]}
{"id": "clm:ec7f4f319f2464eb025e1f00707770172f62ab2bdb1054de5206d6903eba6234", "type": "statement", "text": "Percona documents per-model provider selection: the index model matches catalog modelName, whose embeddingProvider selects the client. The global embedding.providerEndpoint override applies only to VOYAGE; OPENAI_COMPATIBLE models use their catalog endpoint. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)", "source_url": "https://docs.percona.com/percona-search-for-mongodb/configure-automatic-embedding.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["mongot autoEmbed with OpenAI-compatible providers"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://docs.percona.com/percona-search-for-mongodb/automatic-embedding-with-OpenAI-providers.html", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.md", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/configure-automatic-embedding.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:ec96234ec7d4b1e407039b66dc4bc64da4f18da3662e1cbc57eabcb615e68124", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:43588d038c5f0b42aca739ae774f57585441cbeb41fe6b9cc4c4cc6e4ebb5342", "ev:b2dfa2d94981aa80b90c6b097c0b2e78d0cc56037de2d8a1fd3a9d68570fbde1", "ev:faea90357ea5146aad1fd5a6d9069d843017fb94d60ccfe1d38dd47cbeead5e8"]}
{"id": "clm:b358fcabdd4e3bd4d0a7b94c38b21bc663a46418ce843f48484acb1eaef54a4d", "type": "statement", "text": "Percona distinguishes index sizing from dimension forwarding. For autoEmbed, numDimensions is optional, must match the returned vectors, and supports 1–8192; if omitted, mongot uses the model’s outputDimensions. outputDimensions sizes the index. forwardDimensions defaults to false; enabling it sends the resolved dimension as dimensions. Percona restricts forwarding to models that support configurable dimensions. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["mongot autoEmbed with OpenAI-compatible providers"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/configure-automatic-embedding.md", "https://docs.percona.com/percona-search-for-mongodb/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.html", "https://docs.percona.com/percona-search-for-mongodb/configure-automatic-embedding.html", "https://docs.percona.com/percona-search-for-mongodb/automatic-embedding-with-OpenAI-providers.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:ec96234ec7d4b1e407039b66dc4bc64da4f18da3662e1cbc57eabcb615e68124", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1fcc431656b98889e677ff849e4b8e271699c0c0ff201d36be527cbc2dbe32eb", "ev:3dd62c1952236fc2c423e415483d697732e224d7085d320fffc3c0624438d243", "ev:bb6433acfa676ba2025219bc794f452607a1955a4f24e92f93dfe1e5fc52880e", "ev:d14d4f815ac4bf1075ce5c44b3aa0169d823fa6ce43d6581997168c2bcca26cf", "ev:dedca1b91d4ad5c56d4b3b8898d20576b3899372eb9a814e108c1205dbd3bf42"]}
{"id": "clm:aa9a29bc446b2e8ebc7ad74183f78807f2036e966a3f845ad50a83a9d088a4a4", "type": "statement", "text": "Percona’s reference defines batchSize as the maximum number of inputs per request, default 96, and batchTokenLimit as the approximate maximum input-token count per batch, default 120000. Its Ollama setup example explicitly supplies those values. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["mongot autoEmbed with OpenAI-compatible providers"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/configure-automatic-embedding.md", "https://docs.percona.com/percona-search-for-mongodb/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:ec96234ec7d4b1e407039b66dc4bc64da4f18da3662e1cbc57eabcb615e68124", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:2211bb7cb93387df1701e75b55427b092b4ba3dd3fc893e7969855b2ec8fdb76", "ev:6ae6d488519e4317b83abe5a54336821342a7c9f83852bd39c2abf4f14fdbe9e", "ev:a5896fad928ce652ab263e538475ca10fac637200d967a03e50b98c463062bcf", "ev:faea90357ea5146aad1fd5a6d9069d843017fb94d60ccfe1d38dd47cbeead5e8"]}
{"id": "clm:0a4f5bce39ca3ef13e901c0d2d4577e6a82f3b53114aef03e7f5f2350aed54c1", "type": "statement", "text": "Percona documents optional credentials.apiKey and default authHeaderName Authorization with the Bearer scheme; Azure OpenAI uses authHeaderName api-key. Keyless local engines can use credentials: {}. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["mongot autoEmbed with OpenAI-compatible providers"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/configure-automatic-embedding.md", "https://docs.percona.com/percona-search-for-mongodb/configure-automatic-embedding.html", "https://docs.percona.com/percona-search-for-mongodb/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:ec96234ec7d4b1e407039b66dc4bc64da4f18da3662e1cbc57eabcb615e68124", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:b7eae6428bb80b1386cfd907a071aa607215845bb2996f4e927226d2c82d45a8", "ev:ef0f53451f2e1fbc4a555308b0d1193d6c8423a618dee8ae88963cd129a3f20b", "ev:faea90357ea5146aad1fd5a6d9069d843017fb94d60ccfe1d38dd47cbeead5e8"]}
{"id": "clm:8419791ba40aa442ffd7f1b3372e18fd0dcda998e73fbfd6dd4500b9fcd61c5d", "type": "statement", "text": "Percona marks config.errorHandlingConfig as required for OPENAI_COMPATIBLE models. maxRetries limits retry attempts; initialRetryWaitMs sets the first wait in milliseconds; maxRetryWaitMs caps waits in milliseconds; jitter randomizes the wait. The reference says authentication failures are not transient and are not retried. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["mongot autoEmbed with OpenAI-compatible providers"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://docs.percona.com/percona-search-for-mongodb/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:ec96234ec7d4b1e407039b66dc4bc64da4f18da3662e1cbc57eabcb615e68124", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:6ae6d488519e4317b83abe5a54336821342a7c9f83852bd39c2abf4f14fdbe9e", "ev:798577ad369bfd042624f8e3dea2353de5177d3223720cde6a85410b767fc8cb", "ev:d4fee72e9d3e6238395e4637906723d7e781c8f4fc37a115987430141b0508e5", "ev:dedca1b91d4ad5c56d4b3b8898d20576b3899372eb9a814e108c1205dbd3bf42"]}
{"id": "clm:9480396e27ea986415755750fcce0a375f6f36cbcb4ab41ddec19106792e15f1", "type": "statement", "text": "Percona’s Ollama setup example supplies maxRetries 10, initialRetryWaitMs 200, maxRetryWaitMs 10000, and jitter 0.1. These are example values; the reference describes the controls without declaring retry defaults. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/configure-automatic-embedding.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["mongot autoEmbed with OpenAI-compatible providers"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.md", "https://docs.percona.com/percona-search-for-mongodb/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:ec96234ec7d4b1e407039b66dc4bc64da4f18da3662e1cbc57eabcb615e68124", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:2211bb7cb93387df1701e75b55427b092b4ba3dd3fc893e7969855b2ec8fdb76", "ev:798577ad369bfd042624f8e3dea2353de5177d3223720cde6a85410b767fc8cb", "ev:faea90357ea5146aad1fd5a6d9069d843017fb94d60ccfe1d38dd47cbeead5e8", "ev:fc8e1629e034fd9e903c92916ba096242608d55bf91388c79a93c5324333f7e9"]}
{"id": "clm:e28c55023cdd7f99b5576ca9e4faac26bffe4020ab46abd0a541a88afd996011", "type": "statement", "text": "Percona’s published catalog examples differ: the reference shorthand uses provider and a top-level providerEndpoint, while its settings table names config.providerEndpoint; the setup guide uses embeddingProvider and nests providerEndpoint under config. This records documentation positions without establishing which schema a binary accepts. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["mongot autoEmbed with OpenAI-compatible providers"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/configure-automatic-embedding.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:ec96234ec7d4b1e407039b66dc4bc64da4f18da3662e1cbc57eabcb615e68124", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:2211bb7cb93387df1701e75b55427b092b4ba3dd3fc893e7969855b2ec8fdb76", "ev:6e0decdced2105044576ce060da4e8ace1f595a2e04fb03c9aaa8f82966f1229"]}
{"id": "clm:279686ed06504627ed4c29af0c561be804d562b262c35749366e04f4ea43a618", "type": "statement", "text": "Percona’s reference lists config.providerEndpoint as optional with default https://api.openai.com/v1/embeddings; modelName is both the index lookup name and the value sent in the request model field. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-29)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/automatic-embedding-configuration-reference.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["mongot autoEmbed with OpenAI-compatible providers"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:ec96234ec7d4b1e407039b66dc4bc64da4f18da3662e1cbc57eabcb615e68124", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:6e0decdced2105044576ce060da4e8ace1f595a2e04fb03c9aaa8f82966f1229"]}
{"id": "clm:4bc2314643d9dd79365fad87082d4fef44b0e454ce4602ae430bde5b2a5b400c", "type": "statement", "text": "Percona’s keyless-local-engine configuration agrees with Ollama’s local-server documentation, which says the OpenAI client requires an API-key value but Ollama ignores it. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-11-06)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/percona/percona-search-for-mongodb-docs/main/docs/configure-automatic-embedding.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["mongot autoEmbed with OpenAI-compatible providers"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://docs.ollama.com/api/openai-compatibility"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:ec96234ec7d4b1e407039b66dc4bc64da4f18da3662e1cbc57eabcb615e68124", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:11c1e9bcab2c25144331109463f41f036462f47e64af00a4a211348d87a2ecd8", "ev:b7eae6428bb80b1386cfd907a071aa607215845bb2996f4e927226d2c82d45a8", "ev:faea90357ea5146aad1fd5a6d9069d843017fb94d60ccfe1d38dd47cbeead5e8"]}
